# Single-PC HTTPS entry point on this PC (#358, ARCHITECTURE.md "Local
# access interface"): GroceryPOS-Proxy. Chrome on this computer opens
# https://localhost:1443. Caddy serves the compiled client and forwards
# /v1/* to the API on loopback, so the browser sees one origin: no CORS,
# host-only cookies, same-origin CSP reports. LAN terminals are served by a
# separate service and file (Caddyfile.lan, #396), never from here.
#
# Environment (set by the service definition, #360/#362):
#   GPOS_CLIENT_ROOT  the compiled client (apps/client/dist) of this release
import app.caddy

https://localhost:1443 {
	bind 127.0.0.1 [::1]
	import gpos_app
}
